WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.302 --> 00:00:12.137
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

2
00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:16.683
-'Sup! Gym tonight?
-(CLICKS TONGUE)

3
00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:18.352
(LAUGHTER)

4
00:00:19.061 --> 00:00:20.771
(INDISTINCT SHOUTING)

5
00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:23.815
-DREW: Welcome to B.R.O. Capital.
-(ELEVATOR BELL DINGS)

6
00:00:23.899 --> 00:00:27.402
Uh, yeah. So, you'll be up on the
fourth floor with Investments and, uh...

7
00:00:27.486 --> 00:00:30.239
-(CELL PHONE CHIMES)
-What? The Tigers are up by 20?

8
00:00:30.322 --> 00:00:31.823
Yes! (SIGHS)

9
00:00:31.907 --> 00:00:35.702
Anyway, it's entry level
but your resume was by far the strongest.

10
00:00:35.786 --> 00:00:38.872
I'm sure you'll fit right in.

11
00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:45.337
Thanks! I still think it's unbelievable
that I'm really here!

12
00:00:47.005 --> 00:00:49.132
Unbeweaveable.

13
00:00:49.216 --> 00:00:52.177
(CLEARS THROAT) I mean, unbelievable.

14
00:00:53.387 --> 00:00:56.306
Ooh! I'm so excited!

15
00:00:56.390 --> 00:00:59.434
I have a really good feeling about this.

16
00:00:59.518 --> 00:01:01.478
(KEYPAD TAPPING)

17
00:01:01.562 --> 00:01:02.896
(CHUCKLING)

18
00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:05.983
-(CHUCKLES AWKWARDLY)
-(TEXT MESSAGE WHOOSHES)

19
00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:07.276
(ELEVATOR BELL DINGS)

20
00:01:07.359 --> 00:01:09.945
-(INDISTINCT CHATTER)
-(CELL PHONES CHIME)

21
00:01:11.446 --> 00:01:13.532
(DREW WHISTLING)

22
00:01:17.619 --> 00:01:19.705
(BREATHES DEEPLY)

23
00:01:21.832 --> 00:01:23.375
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

24
00:01:24.418 --> 00:01:25.502
Good morning!

25
00:01:27.713 --> 00:01:28.714
Hi there!

26
00:01:28.797 --> 00:01:31.175
Did you see they hired a ball of... Yow.

27
00:01:38.223 --> 00:01:40.601
(SIGHS) Morning, gentlemen.

28
00:01:50.319 --> 00:01:52.196
(LAPTOP TURNS ON)

29
00:01:52.863 --> 00:01:54.156
(WHISPERING INDISTINCTLY)

30
00:01:56.491 --> 00:02:00.204
Hey, what's the difference
between a porcupine and a BMW?

31
00:02:00.287 --> 00:02:02.706
With a porcupine,
the pricks are on the outside!

32
00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:04.458
(MEN LAUGHING)

33
00:02:07.336 --> 00:02:10.005
(PURL LAUGHING FORCEFULLY)

34
00:02:12.883 --> 00:02:14.301
Good one.

35
00:02:14.384 --> 00:02:17.304
So, why do spiders weave webs?

36
00:02:20.807 --> 00:02:24.186
'Cause they don't know how to crochet.

37
00:02:24.269 --> 00:02:25.771
(LAUGHS NERVOUSLY)

38
00:02:27.773 --> 00:02:29.858
Is that like a sport or something?

39
00:02:29.942 --> 00:02:33.612
Like, with the needles and... You know?

40
00:02:34.446 --> 00:02:36.865
(LAUGHS, SIGHS)

41
00:02:36.949 --> 00:02:38.575
(GROANS)

42
00:02:42.871 --> 00:02:44.456
TROY: Hey, guys! Staff meeting!

43
00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:46.124
-(INDISTINCT CHATTER)
-(GASPS)

44
00:02:47.292 --> 00:02:50.462
TROY: As you can see, we've got
a big, fat failure on our hands.

45
00:02:51.129 --> 00:02:54.591
So, Finance wants answers. Ideas?

46
00:02:55.175 --> 00:02:56.260
Uh, excuse me.

47
00:02:56.343 --> 00:02:57.636
(GRUNTS)

48
00:02:57.719 --> 00:02:59.721
(INDISTINCT DISCUSSION)

49
00:03:01.473 --> 00:03:03.642
PURL: (SIGHS) Hmm.

50
00:03:04.142 --> 00:03:05.269
Mmm.

51
00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:10.482
Ooh! Guys! Let's bring Finance in
and knit our strategies together.

52
00:03:10.566 --> 00:03:12.818
What? Nah, you're being too soft!

53
00:03:12.901 --> 00:03:15.112
-We gotta be aggressive!
-Yeah! We got to be aggressive!

54
00:03:15.195 --> 00:03:16.864
(INDISTINCT YELLING)

55
00:03:21.493 --> 00:03:23.954
All right, all right! Okay!
Let's put a pin in it.

56
00:03:24.037 --> 00:03:25.956
Who's down for
two-for-one wings at Swifty's?

57
00:03:26.039 --> 00:03:27.040
MAN: Oh, yeah!

58
00:03:27.124 --> 00:03:29.042
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

59
00:03:33.589 --> 00:03:34.715
Hey, we got everybody?

60
00:03:37.509 --> 00:03:38.927
Yeah. That's everybody.

61
00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:42.431
All right, first round's on Gronkowski!

62
00:03:42.514 --> 00:03:45.392
-(MEN CACKLING)
-(ELEVATOR CLOSES)

63
00:03:46.935 --> 00:03:48.604
(SIGHS)

64
00:04:08.207 --> 00:04:10.042
(UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING)

65
00:04:15.839 --> 00:04:18.550
-(ELEVATOR BELL DINGS)
-(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

66
00:04:20.052 --> 00:04:23.055
-GRONKOWSKI: What the...
-Gronkowski.

67
00:04:24.473 --> 00:04:25.766
Purl.

68
00:04:32.564 --> 00:04:33.565
(CLICKS TONGUE)

69
00:04:34.233 --> 00:04:36.985
-Did she always sit there?
-I didn't even recognize her.

70
00:04:40.906 --> 00:04:45.118
So then he says,
"I know this suit is expensive, baby,

71
00:04:45.202 --> 00:04:49.289
"but at my apartment, it's 100% off!"

72
00:04:49.373 --> 00:04:50.791
(ALL LAUGH)

73
00:04:50.874 --> 00:04:53.293
Whoa! She tells better jokes than you do!

74
00:04:53.377 --> 00:04:55.462
TROY: Hey, guys! Staff meeting.

75
00:04:57.673 --> 00:05:00.008
TROY: Well, these results
speak for themselves.

76
00:05:00.092 --> 00:05:01.593
But Finance is still asking for...

77
00:05:01.677 --> 00:05:03.178
I say we go for it,

78
00:05:03.262 --> 00:05:05.180
and if Finance doesn't like it,

79
00:05:05.264 --> 00:05:08.517
they can kiss our ass!

80
00:05:09.726 --> 00:05:11.728
(ALL AGREEING AND CHEERING)

81
00:05:13.605 --> 00:05:14.773
PURL: Whoo, whoo, whoo.

82
00:05:14.857 --> 00:05:16.650
Well, it's five o'clock somewhere.

83
00:05:16.733 --> 00:05:18.861
Let's go! Happy hour at Swifty's!

84
00:05:18.944 --> 00:05:20.404
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

85
00:05:22.114 --> 00:05:23.490
Is that everybody?

86
00:05:26.285 --> 00:05:27.911
Hold up. Not everybody.

87
00:05:30.497 --> 00:05:32.332
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

88
00:05:34.918 --> 00:05:38.463
-You're gonna love this place, Purl.
-Purl, you're gonna eat so many wings!

89
00:05:38.547 --> 00:05:40.799
-Purl, I love your new look!
-Purl, come over here.

90
00:05:40.883 --> 00:05:41.884
Purl...

91
00:05:41.967 --> 00:05:44.052
(CROWD CHEERING)

92
00:05:44.136 --> 00:05:45.554
(ALL CHEERING)

93
00:05:47.723 --> 00:05:49.016
(VOMITS)

94
00:05:49.766 --> 00:05:50.893
(ALL CHEERING)

95
00:05:53.604 --> 00:05:54.938
(ELEVATOR BELL DINGS)

96
00:05:57.524 --> 00:05:59.776
Oh, thank goodness you're still here.

97
00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:02.112
I had such a time
trying to find this place.

98
00:06:02.196 --> 00:06:04.031
(SIGHS) I missed my stop
and then I didn't know

99
00:06:04.114 --> 00:06:05.991
what floor we were on 'cause...
Excuse me, sir.

100
00:06:06.074 --> 00:06:09.661
'Cause Kyle from HR went home early.
So I went door to door up each flight.

101
00:06:09.745 --> 00:06:12.748
(SCOFFS) Leave the knitting
at your nana's house.

102
00:06:12.831 --> 00:06:15.334
-(MEN LAUGHING)
-LACY: What I mean to say is

103
00:06:15.417 --> 00:06:18.086
that I can't wait to be part of the team.

104
00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:19.171
Guys?

105
00:06:39.191 --> 00:06:40.526
(LACY SIGHS)

106
00:06:42.611 --> 00:06:43.946
(GRUNTS)

107
00:06:46.448 --> 00:06:47.991
Hey, where you goin'?

108
00:06:53.038 --> 00:06:54.414
Hi. I'm Purl.

109
00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.168
I'm Lacy.

110
00:06:58.252 --> 00:07:00.254
-Oh, I'm so glad it's over.
-What are they doing?

111
00:07:00.337 --> 00:07:03.090
-LACY: (CHUCKLES) It was such a fright.
-(PURL CHUCKLES)

112
00:07:03.173 --> 00:07:04.967
Hey, guys. This is Lacy.

113
00:07:10.013 --> 00:07:12.099
Mm... Heh.

114
00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:18.021
-(ELEVATOR BELL DINGS)
-PURL: Welcome to B.R.O. Capital.

115
00:07:18.105 --> 00:07:20.607
You'll be up on the fourth floor
with Investments.

116
00:07:20.691 --> 00:07:24.152
Thanks! It's still kind of
unbelievable that I'm here!

117
00:07:24.236 --> 00:07:26.780
I would say it's unbeweavable.

118
00:07:26.864 --> 00:07:28.365
(BOTH CHUCKLE)

119
00:07:28.907 --> 00:07:30.617
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

120
00:07:32.202 --> 00:07:33.579
(LAUGHTER)

121
00:07:33.662 --> 00:07:35.122
(INDISTINCT DISCUSSION)

122
00:07:36.415 --> 00:07:39.459
Wow. I have
a really good feeling about this.

123
00:07:39.543 --> 00:07:41.461
Well, come on, let me show you around.

124
00:07:41.545 --> 00:07:42.921
Tell us all about yourself!

125
00:07:43.005 --> 00:07:45.048
We do love a good yarn!

126
00:07:45.132 --> 00:07:47.467
Hey, Purl!
You guys coming to Swifty's tonight?

127
00:07:47.551 --> 00:07:49.595
Is a wool sweater scratchy?

128
00:07:49.678 --> 00:07:52.181
-(ALL LAUGH)
-MAN: Yeah, nice one!

129
00:07:53.182 --> 00:07:55.184
(JAZZ MUSIC PLAYING)
